The {{Term/Store|Nintendo Switch Shirt||Series, BotW}} is an [[Item]] in {{BotW}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> It is a bonus piece of [[Armor]] exclusive to the Expansion Pass. The Shirt is also available in the [[Wii U]] version of the game, also featuring the [[Nintendo Switch]] logo.

==Location and Uses==
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Nintendo Switch Shirt can be found inside a [[Treasure Chest]] located atop a wall in the [[Eastern Abbey]] on the [[Great Plateau]]. After [[Link]] obtains the Shirt, [[Granté]] will begin selling it for 50 [[Rupee]]s.{{Note|Prior to the {{Version|BotW|1.3.3}}, Granté would not sell any Armor that is exclusive to the Expansion Pass or [[The Master Trials]] DLC Pack. This meant that the Nintendo Switch Shirt could not be replaced if sold, which was noted in the Shirt's description.<ref name="BotW Inventory 2"/> The description of the Nintendo Switch Shirt was changed in the {{Version|BotW|1.3.3}} Update as the Shirt could now be replaced.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>}}

